    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not a \"lesson\" though. it's not something you just move on from. some things are just permanent. i feel like i've left this permanent stain on everything i touch. how can anyone expect me to just \"learn\" and \"grow\" when the damage is already done? it's like i'm just a source of harm now.",
